---
description: Blender MCP bridge and jewelry CAD conventions for this repo
globs:
  - mcp_server/**
  - blender_addon/**
  - agent/**
---

- Prefer typed MCP tools over `run_script`; script exec requires env + confirm + addon pref.
- Scene units: metric mm (`scale_length=0.001`, `length_unit=MILLIMETERS`) for manufacturing workflows.
- Blender bridge: localhost TCP `127.0.0.1:8765`; all `bpy` on main thread via addon queue.
- Propagate `BLENDER_ASSIST_JOB_ID` in logs when automating from `agent/`.
